            "Na podstawie: J. Baj, Mikrobiologia, Warszawa 2018; W. Irving i in., Krtkie wyklady. Mikrobiologia medyczna, Warszawa 2008; B. Springer i in., Mechanisms of Streptomycin Resistance: Selection of Mutations in the 16S rRNA Gene Conferring Resistance,",
